# 14. RQ4: What Components of Reflection Matter?

## 14.1 Validation Outcome Feedback Ablation

The central mechanism consists of feedback from both mining and validation outcomes.

We therefore compare:

### Full Reflective-FDPO

```text
Mining recoveries
Mining regressions
Validation recoveries
Validation regressions
```

against:

### Mining-Only Reflection

```text
Mining recoveries
Mining regressions
