# Appendix C. Prompt Optimization Algorithm

```text
Algorithm 1: Reflective-FDPO

Input:
    seed prompt p0
    mining set Dm
    validation set Dv
    sealed test set Dt
    solver M
    optimizer O
    number of rounds T

1: Evaluate p0 on Dm and Dv
2: Record baseline outcomes
3: candidates ← ∅

4: for t = 1 ... T do

5:     if t = 1 then
6:         feedback ← current failure feedback
7:     else
8:         feedback ←
9:             current failures
10:            + mining recoveries
11:            + mining regressions
12:            + validation recoveries
13:            + validation regressions
14:            + previous prompt sections
15:     end if

16:     p_t ← O(p_(t-1), feedback)

17:     Evaluate p_t on Dm
18:     Evaluate p_t on Dv

19:     Compute recoveries and regressions
20:     Store complete prompt version
21:     candidates ← candidates ∪ {p_t}

22: end for

23: p* ← best committed prompt according to validation score

24: Evaluate p* exactly once on sealed test set Dt

25: return p*
```

